## Objective

Introduce explicit heritable molecular information only after the M0-M2 numerical/physiological foundation passed its gates.

## Implemented

- discrete 12-locus ancestral genome;
- stable locus IDs;
- promoter codes, 16-bit protein signatures, and guaranteed-neutral markers;
- deterministic canonical genotype identity/fingerprint;
- deep-copy inheritance with no mutable aliasing between parent/sisters;
- deterministic mutation engine using only the simulation RNG;
- promoter, signature-bit, and neutral-marker mutation operators;
- mutation configuration and validation;
- mutation events linked to daughter, parent, generation, locus, old/new value, and parental/resulting genotype;
- live genotype and mutation counters in the observer UI;
- M3 genetics design documentation;
- expanded invariant/statistical tests.

## Scientific boundary

M3 intentionally keeps all new genomic fields phenotypically neutral. Basal M0-M2 physiology remains transitional scaffolding. M4 will make protein signatures functional only after the catalytic-affinity landscape has been characterized; M5 will make promoter/regulatory information functional through costly expression dynamics.

This prevents us from conflating a working inheritance system with a working adaptive genotype-to-phenotype map.

## Validation focus

- exact mutation-free inheritance;
- independent genomes between parent and sisters;
- parent immutability under child mutation;
- exact same-seed mutation sequence;
- different-seed mutation contingency;
- neutral-marker physiological neutrality;
- realized mutation count consistent with configured Bernoulli rate;
- semantic mutation ancestry records;
- complete same-seed event-history/state reproducibility.

Draft until Godot 4.7.2 parser and full headless suite are green.

### 💡 Background & Problems
1. **Lack of Persistence & History**: The existing comment fraud detection only displayed a transient popup dialog. Once dismissed, comment audit snapshots were lost, lacking historical tracking and on-demand re-checking capabilities.
2. **Root & Sub-Reply Probing Inaccuracies**:
   - Root comment detection was prone to false-positive "Deleted" reports because \`next=1\` pagination offset skipped page 1;
   - Sub-reply detection originally probed the main list (limited to 3 preview items), causing sub-replies outside the top 3 to be falsely flagged as deleted;
   - Probing without active \`buvid3\` headers caused anti-bot WAF ghost null responses.

### 🛠️ Key Improvements & New Features
1. **Accurate Detection Engine**:
   - Corrected root comment pagination offset to \`next=0\`;
   - Refactored sub-reply probing to use \`getReplyReply\` with adaptive last-page jumping and monotonic temporal binary search (max 5 steps) for deep/grown threads;
   - Isolated a private \`fraudAnonymousApi\` in \`CommentRepository\` with active \`buvid3\` visitor tokens to prevent WAF null drops.
2. **Room Database Persistence**:
   - Added \`comment_fraud_records\` Room entity (Version 6) and DAO;
   - Implemented non-blocking asynchronous persistence in \`CommentRepository.addCommentForSubject\` across all comment origins (video detail, player bottom bar, dynamic feed);
   - Built a 3-step lifecycle state machine (\`UNKNOWN\` on post -> sync true status on detection completion -> preserve initial status on subsequent re-checks to distinguish immediate moderation from delayed bans/秋后算账).
3. **Native Jetpack Compose History Center**:
   - Added \`CommentFraudHistoryScreen\` under Settings -> Privacy & Permissions (styled with BiliPai native Miuix/Material tokens);
   - In-place accordion card expansion with comprehensive metadata inspection (UID, RPID, OID, ctime, root/parent IDs, and lifecycle fraud assessment);
   - Supports on-demand re-checking, URI Scheme extraction, true Bilibili deletion, and SAF-based \`.json\` backup import/export (100% interoperable with Web \`biliSendCheck\`).

---
> 🤖 *Note: This feature was designed and developed through human-AI pair programming, fully tested on real devices, with all verification checks passed.*

## Objectif

Rendre la précommande du Livre I plus transparente avant toute future vente, sans activer de paiement ni service externe.

## Expérience

Le résumé affiche :
- le prix du livre uniquement s’il a été officiellement publié;
- les frais de livraison comme étant à la charge du client;
- une fourchette de livraison uniquement depuis une zone publiée;
- le ramassage sur place avec 0 $ de frais de livraison;
- un total estimatif uniquement quand toutes les données nécessaires sont connues et dans la même monnaie;
- sinon « Total estimatif indisponible pour le moment ».

Aucune adresse exacte n’est demandée pour l’estimation. Une valeur `null` ne peut jamais être interprétée comme un prix ou tarif de 0 $.

## Architecture

Frontend-only. Réutilise :
- `product_preorder_commercial_info`
- `product_preorder_fulfillment_options`
- `product_preorder_shipping_estimate`

Aucune migration Supabase. Le ledger reste à 156 migrations, dernière migration V24.5.24.

## Verrous

- réservation ≠ vente;
- aucun prélèvement;
- sales/checkout/payment restent désactivés;
- aucune API transporteur;
- aucun fournisseur payant activé.

## Why

PR #32 made the Kopano Labs / founder / Ama-Phu entity graph live, but the follow-up still depended on manual inspection and the build only proved sitemap/robots syntax before rendering route shells.

This PR closes the website-side gap without claiming Google indexing state.

## Changes

- make the public crawler default explicit with exactly one `Allow: /`;
- preserve only the existing protected operational prefixes as `Disallow` rules;
- fail the crawl gate if any public route/artifact falls under a blocked prefix or the canonical sitemap directive drifts;
- derive rendered route-shell robots metadata from route index state;
- add a post-render `indexability:verify` gate proving every public indexed route has:
  - no `noindex`;
  - canonical `index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1,max-video-preview:-1`;
  - canonical URL;
  - manifest-governed title and description;
- keep `/adaptive-player/` explicitly `noindex,nofollow` until governed promotion because it remains a POC-only route outside the crawl manifest;
- add `WebSite` and `/about/` `WebPage` schema nodes connecting the Kopano Labs Organization, founder Person and separate Ama-Phu Organization;
- add human + machine-readable receipts separating website readiness from the still-external Google Search Console control plane.

## Live precheck

Before changing code, production returned:

- `/about/` → 200, canonical HTML, index/follow, entity JSON-LD;
- `/entities.json` → 200 `application/json`;
- `/sitemap.xml` → 200 `application/xml`, contains `/about/`;
- `/robots.txt` → 200 and advertises the canonical sitemap;
- `/evidence.json` → 200 `application/json`.

## Boundary

`HTTP 200 != indexed`

`SITEMAP MEMBER != GOOGLE INDEXED`

Search Console sitemap submission and URL Inspection remain pending until an external Search Console receipt exists. No Search Console connector is available in this execution lane.

